cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use ebsdsim in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "ebsdsim: GPU-accelerated dynamical simulation of EBSD Kikuchi master patterns"
abstract: >-
  ebsdsim computes dynamical electron backscatter diffraction master
  patterns from a crystal structure. Kikuchi master patterns are
  simulated using multi-beam dynamical electron diffraction and
  weighted by modeled electron depth and energy-loss distributions
  for a given beam voltage and specimen tilt. The simulation is
  GPU-accelerated and the package is written in Python.
